      "writtenOn": "2026-02-03T21:09:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "FinalizeMapImpl() is called from [here](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/Buffer.cpp;l\u003d579;drc\u003d5117752baca0cafbdbb394c345d8d8bbebfdb54b) and SetInitialized(true) is later [here](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/Buffer.cpp;l\u003d602;drc\u003d5117752baca0cafbdbb394c345d8d8bbebfdb54b). So NeedsInitialization() is true when this runs now.\n\nAttempting to initialize to zero here is missing two conditions, !DisableLazyClearForMappedAtCreationBuffer and !usingStagingBuffer, that are checked in BufferBase::MapAtCreation().\n\nThat\u0027s not to say I don\u0027t think we could make this better but it\u0027s not immediately clear how to reorganize things.",
      "parentUuid": "520246b8_e2eecc81",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 203,
        "startChar": 73,
